n3 函数","实例"],"titleOccurrence":2,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-function.html","sourceSha256":"12ffaae480923ce0ff0af5f245dc5a171255256382d3a6e0f7bcf294e1a25fd2","articleSourceOrder":24,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.e0d0fdb5491aca411f05f17a","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","status":"context-only"},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-function#return%20%E8%AF%AD%E5%8F%A5~1","parent":"py3-source/python3-function","order":31,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"return 语句","titleDisplay":"return 语句","titlePath":["Python3 函数","return 语句"],"titleOccurrence":1,"role":"section","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-function.html","sourceSha256":"12ffaae480923ce0ff0af5f245dc5a171255256382d3a6e0f7bcf294e1a25fd2","articleSourceOrder":24,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.d1bddf5bd79531abe3bc3c67","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","leaf":true,"activityId":"py3.practice.function-return","exampleId":"py3.section.d1bddf5bd79531abe3bc3c67.example","questionId":"py3.practice.function-return","status":"authored","goal":"观察两次函数调用的参数与返回值，区分返回给调用者和写到输出区。","body":["toll 根据小时数计算费用。短时停留走第一个 return，函数在这一条语句后就把 5 交给调用者。超过一小时则继续执行后面的计算，交还累计费用。","print 的两个实参依次求值。第一次和第二次调用各有自己的 hours 和栈帧，栈帧退出后返回值仍能参与调用者表达式。把 return 改成 print 只会写入输出，函数自然结束时交还的是 None。"]},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-function#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B(Python%203.0%2B)~14","parent":"py3-source/python3-function","order":32,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"实例(Python 3.0+)","titleDisplay":"实例(Python 3.0+)","titlePath":["Python3 函数","实例(Python 3.0+)"],"titleOccurrence":14,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-function.html","sourceSha256":"12ffaae480923ce0ff0af5f245dc5a171255256382d3a6e0f7bcf294e1a25fd2","articleSourceOrder":24,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.0d67d7db1526be1b06b