"抛 TypeError，需构造新字符串。"},{"id":"py3.section.f79feedac6e8cb09d0ad15be.example","lessonId":"py3.section.f79feedac6e8cb09d0ad15be","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"外层 n=4，函数内 x=x+1 后 n 是多少？","result":"4，外层名字仍指向原对象。"},{"id":"py3.section.608e6d8d6e0820dc49b97681.example","lessonId":"py3.section.608e6d8d6e0820dc49b97681","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"函数对传来的空列表 append(3)，调用后列表是什么？","result":"[3]，修改作用于共享对象。"},{"id":"py3.section.3a54a865522ed18354867375.example","lessonId":"py3.section.3a54a865522ed18354867375","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"def add(a,b) 接受 add(1) 吗？","result":"不接受，b 缺失。"},{"id":"py3.section.c5a57995f4e66743d3db3a74.example","lessonId":"py3.section.c5a57995f4e66743d3db3a74","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"f(a,b) 收到 f(b=2,a=1) 时 a 是什么？","result":"1。"},{"id":"py3.section.4d849b5bbd46f87ee40920bc.example","lessonId":"py3.section.4d849b5bbd46f87ee40920bc","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"默认值设为 []，连续两次省略参数会用几个列表？","result":"一个共享默认列表，需每次新建时用 None 判断。"},{"id":"py3.section.2100385e4dce0e6cf346c71f.example","lessonId":"py3.section.2100385e4dce0e6cf346c71f","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"f(*xs,**kw) 收到 f(1,2,x=3)，xs 和 kw 是什么？","result":"(1,2) 和 {'x':3}。"},{"id":"py3.section.32f9f72c8daca9fbcf25dca3.example","lessonId":"py3.section.32f9f72c8daca9fbcf25dca3","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"(lambda x:x+3)(2) 的值是多少？","result":"5。"},{"id":"py3.section.d1bddf5bd79531abe3bc3c67.example","lessonId":"py3.section.d1bddf5bd79531abe3bc3c67","status":"runnable-required","reason":"原创完整程序，使用同一受限 Rust/WASM 实际运行","source":"def toll(hours):\n    if hours <= 1:\n        return 5\n    # 返回给调用者，由调用者决定怎样展示。\n    return 5 + (hours - 1) * 3\n\nfirst = int(input())\nprint(toll(first), toll(first + 1))","sourceSha256":"443604065033e4a7b8781d461eb0395f7b4c9b47321a36786307c76936477c7d","cases":[{"name":"两次各自计算","input":"2\n","stdout":"8 11\n"},{"name":"两次命中不同返回点","input":"1\n","stdout":"5 8\n"}]},{"id":"py3.section.0a695a44fe4d2aeab7a2c50b.example","lessonId":"py3.section.0a695a44fe4d2aeab7a2c50b","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"def f(a,/,b) 能接受 f(a=1,b=2) 吗？","result":"不能，a 必须按位置传入。"}],"activities":[{"id":"py3.section.536997a288588e12e6eaf776.check","lessonId":"py3.section.536997a288588e12e6eaf776","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.536997a288588e12e6eaf776.example","prompt":"函数体无 return，到末尾返回什么？","reveal":"None。"},{"id":"py3.section.3ecd8465d380bdb0a7d93362.check","lessonId":"py3.section.3ecd8465d380bdb0a7d93362","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.3ecd8465d380bdb0a7d93362.example","prompt":"def twice(x): return x*2，twice(4) 的值？","reveal":"8，表达式可继续参与计算。"},{"id":"py3.section.b325f74b16eda8755026eb93.check","lessonId":"py3.section.b325f74b16eda8755026eb93","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.b325f74b16eda8755026eb93.example","prompt":"定义里有 print，模块只执行定义时有输出吗？","reveal":"函数体里的 print 尚未执行。"},{"id":"py3.section.2b91d5e9a263fcc745e7eb16.check","lessonId":"py3.section.2b91d5e9a263fcc745e7eb16","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.2b91d5e9a263fcc745e7eb16.example","prompt":"字符串 s[0]='A' 会怎样？","reveal":"抛 TypeError，需构造新字符串。"},{"id":"py3.section.f79feedac6e8cb09d0ad15be.check","lessonId":"py3.section.f79feedac6e8cb09d0ad15be","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.f79feedac6e8cb09d0ad15be.example","prompt":"外层 n=4，函数内 x=x+1 后 n 是多少？","reveal":"4，外层名字仍指向原对象。"},{"id":"py3.section.608e6d8d6e0820dc49b97681.check","lessonId":"py3.section.608e6d8d6e0820dc49b97681","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":